1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,550
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,925 --> 00:00:12,075
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,759
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,325 --> 00:00:22,306
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:28,204
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,204 --> 00:00:30,444
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:35,340
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,025 --> 00:00:39,673
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:44,076
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,775 --> 00:00:49,250
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:52,898
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:58,207
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,207 --> 00:01:01,855
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,334 --> 00:01:09,291
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,123 --> 00:01:15,643
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,643 --> 00:01:18,317
=Episode 17=

17
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:25,375
(Dongcheng Construction Company)

18
00:01:25,590 --> 00:01:27,389
Lin's place has drugs in it.

19
00:01:28,430 --> 00:01:29,790
Now the cops have been

20
00:01:30,029 --> 00:01:31,389
watching us like hawks.

21
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:33,350
None of us can do business.

22
00:01:34,189 --> 00:01:34,990
This matter

23
00:01:35,990 --> 00:01:37,269
needs to be dealt with.

24
00:01:37,975 --> 00:01:38,537
Hey.

25
00:01:39,309 --> 00:01:40,590
Lin just lost his brother.

26
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:42,389
Do we really

27
00:01:43,469 --> 00:01:44,350
have to do this today?

28
00:01:46,109 --> 00:01:48,109
That's not how it works.

29
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:51,269
The dead aren't coming back.

30
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,189
But

31
00:01:52,669 --> 00:01:54,109
the rest of us still have to make money

32
00:01:54,549 --> 00:01:56,389
and keep going.

33
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:57,749
Exactly.

34
00:01:58,469 --> 00:01:59,309
For this,

35
00:01:59,909 --> 00:02:00,950
Lin has to take responsibility.

36
00:02:02,130 --> 00:02:04,690
We can't just sweep it under the rug.

37
00:02:06,549 --> 00:02:07,309
So,

38
00:02:08,989 --> 00:02:09,790
what do you all want?

39
00:02:12,829 --> 00:02:13,510
Lin.

40
00:02:14,510 --> 00:02:16,549
Boss Hui entrusted his business to you,

41
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:19,829
and you let him down.

42
00:02:20,549 --> 00:02:21,470
Since you

43
00:02:21,989 --> 00:02:23,109
don't have what it takes

44
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:25,829
to run the entertainment club properly,

45
00:02:27,070 --> 00:02:28,310
you should hand it

46
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:29,149
over to someone else.

47
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:31,829
Don't dress it up.

48
00:02:32,589 --> 00:02:34,470
You're kicking him while he's down.

49
00:02:34,950 --> 00:02:37,070
You know why Hui left the business
to Lin,

50
00:02:37,510 --> 00:02:38,669
and you know why all this happened.

51
00:02:39,389 --> 00:02:39,989
Don't you?

52
00:02:40,989 --> 00:02:42,030
Of course I do.

53
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:44,400
That day,

54
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:46,829
Boss Hui admitted it himself
in front of everyone.

55
00:02:48,510 --> 00:02:49,669
He killed Boss Hai.

56
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:51,989
Yong.

57
00:02:53,989 --> 00:02:55,750
What's the first rule of Dongcheng Gang?

58
00:03:02,549 --> 00:03:04,829
A shot-caller must never touch drugs.

59
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:08,030
If Lin keeps running
the entertainment club,

60
00:03:09,350 --> 00:03:10,500
it'll seriously damage

61
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:12,549
Dongcheng Gang's reputation.

62
00:03:13,630 --> 00:03:14,310
As for me,

63
00:03:15,510 --> 00:03:17,230
taking over this little place

64
00:03:18,950 --> 00:03:20,109
isn't exactly my first choice either.

65
00:03:25,149 --> 00:03:26,630
If you won't hand over
the entertainment club,

66
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:28,149
fine.

67
00:03:28,829 --> 00:03:29,350
Then Lin

68
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:33,230
has to drop out of the shot-caller race.

69
00:03:47,709 --> 00:03:48,709
Then the entertainment club

70
00:03:50,230 --> 00:03:51,589
is yours, Boss Tai.

71
00:03:56,240 --> 00:04:03,000
(Loyalty)

72
00:04:13,709 --> 00:04:15,149
We'll find a way through this.

73
00:04:17,469 --> 00:04:18,510
My brother was timid.

74
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,029
He hated seeing people fight.

75
00:04:22,430 --> 00:04:23,149
Lin.

76
00:04:24,829 --> 00:04:26,870
Live well for Fu too.

77
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:35,589
Just thinking about that kid's
miserable face

78
00:04:35,990 --> 00:04:37,990
makes me feel darn good.

79
00:04:39,990 --> 00:04:43,029
That move of yours really cut him off
at the knees.

80
00:04:43,029 --> 00:04:43,670
Impressive.

81
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:48,469
Boss Liu.

82
00:04:48,829 --> 00:04:50,430
I have no idea

83
00:04:50,709 --> 00:04:51,709
what you're talking about.

84
00:04:52,789 --> 00:04:57,349
I'm just doing my best for our company.

85
00:04:58,229 --> 00:04:59,510
No tricks involved.

86
00:05:03,469 --> 00:05:06,349
Yaba at the entertainment club

87
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,909
was our stuff, wasn't it?

88
00:05:09,310 --> 00:05:10,469
Now that we have the entertainment club,

89
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:12,469
making money

90
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:14,510
will be a lot easier.

91
00:05:27,389 --> 00:05:28,550
I heard from the guys

92
00:05:29,110 --> 00:05:30,269
you went out to handle something
that day.

93
00:05:31,709 --> 00:05:32,469
Did it go well?

94
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:34,229
The ecstasy pills found
at the entertainment club

95
00:05:35,389 --> 00:05:36,750
aren't like the ones on the street.

96
00:05:38,029 --> 00:05:38,789
They've been modified.

97
00:05:41,229 --> 00:05:41,789
The entertainment club

98
00:05:42,269 --> 00:05:44,029
is our only chance now.

99
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,029
We can't let it slip away.

100
00:06:07,909 --> 00:06:09,269
(His belongings are in the box.)

101
00:06:09,389 --> 00:06:10,510
(Sign here, and you can take them.)

102
00:06:25,925 --> 00:06:30,800
(Ling Che)

103
00:06:43,990 --> 00:06:44,630
Officer.

104
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,070
How did

105
00:06:49,789 --> 00:06:50,550
my brother die?

106
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:52,789
He died in a traffic accident.

107
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:06,909
Where did it happen?

108
00:07:07,950 --> 00:07:09,950
On Tika Road, near Rongxing Building.

109
00:07:49,389 --> 00:07:51,990
One each.

110
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:54,469
You're giving me your favorite egg tart?

111
00:07:54,709 --> 00:07:55,189
Mm-hmm.

112
00:07:57,269 --> 00:07:57,723
Thanks.

113
00:08:04,229 --> 00:08:05,510
(Shake hands.)

114
00:08:06,430 --> 00:08:11,029
(Che is Lin's brother too.)

115
00:08:11,709 --> 00:08:14,229
(It won't hurt once you put it on.)

116
00:08:20,510 --> 00:08:23,070
(Che, run!)

117
00:08:34,933 --> 00:08:36,349
Alright. That's it.

118
00:08:40,550 --> 00:08:41,709
What are you doing here?

119
00:08:43,349 --> 00:08:44,030
Do you have any idea

120
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:45,509
you could get both of us killed?

121
00:08:45,749 --> 00:08:46,380
From where you're standing,

122
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:47,589
you can see the building
across the street.

123
00:08:48,509 --> 00:08:49,190
Did you have something to do

124
00:08:50,190 --> 00:08:51,390
with his death?

125
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:53,910
We're talking about a human life here.

126
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:55,390
I'm a cop,

127
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:56,509
not a gangster.

128
00:09:11,310 --> 00:09:12,390
I got him killed.

129
00:09:14,869 --> 00:09:16,469
I lied and told him I was going
to buy egg tarts.

130
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:18,989
That's why he followed me out.

131
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:26,030
We still haven't found the driver,

132
00:09:26,589 --> 00:09:27,641
but we've already

133
00:09:27,642 --> 00:09:28,869
gone over the scene.

134
00:09:29,190 --> 00:09:30,270
It was an accident.

135
00:09:30,869 --> 00:09:32,349
You don't need to blame yourself.

136
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:39,070
Could Dongshan Tai have done it?

137
00:09:41,229 --> 00:09:41,910
Lin Che.

138
00:09:42,749 --> 00:09:44,869
Don't let this get to you.

139
00:09:45,190 --> 00:09:47,469
We're at the most critical stage
of the operation.

140
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,270
The operation?

141
00:09:48,469 --> 00:09:50,030
I'm human, not a machine.

142
00:09:50,229 --> 00:09:50,950
Like you said,

143
00:09:50,950 --> 00:09:51,829
we're talking about a human life here.

144
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:54,030
He may have spent his whole life
around Dongcheng Gang,

145
00:09:54,030 --> 00:09:55,430
but he never did anything wrong.

146
00:09:56,190 --> 00:09:56,657
When he saw

147
00:09:56,658 --> 00:09:57,709
the two of us together, he thought...

148
00:09:57,869 --> 00:09:59,030
he thought the police were going
to hurt me.

149
00:09:59,030 --> 00:09:59,550
That's why he...

150
00:10:00,829 --> 00:10:02,150
That's why he ran into the street,
and then...

151
00:10:04,430 --> 00:10:05,390
He was trying to protect me.

152
00:10:05,390 --> 00:10:06,390
He didn't understand any of this.

153
00:10:12,629 --> 00:10:13,270
Officer Luo.

154
00:10:15,950 --> 00:10:16,749
I'm begging you.

155
00:10:17,869 --> 00:10:19,310
I just want to know the truth.

156
00:10:20,989 --> 00:10:22,349
If it really was an accident,

157
00:10:22,869 --> 00:10:24,270
I'll finish the mission.

158
00:10:37,390 --> 00:10:38,670
You were never here today.

159
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:39,790
I never saw you.

160
00:10:40,109 --> 00:10:40,589
Go.

161
00:10:41,509 --> 00:10:42,190
Thank you, Officer Luo.

162
00:10:59,270 --> 00:11:00,200
Here's what you asked for.

163
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,469
(Personnel File)

164
00:11:16,430 --> 00:11:17,109
Boss Lin.

165
00:11:17,829 --> 00:11:19,190
The car involved was burned.

166
00:11:19,950 --> 00:11:21,589
But Dazui and Tidao found the owner.

167
00:11:22,150 --> 00:11:23,070
They brought him back.

168
00:11:24,989 --> 00:11:26,070
He says the car was stolen

169
00:11:26,469 --> 00:11:27,310
and that he reported it.

170
00:11:28,109 --> 00:11:29,190
But I checked with the station.

171
00:11:30,749 --> 00:11:31,709
There's no record of any report.

172
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:34,589
And one more thing.

173
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:40,749
Boss Che's been looking
into the car too.

174
00:11:50,550 --> 00:11:51,229
Sir! Please!

175
00:11:51,229 --> 00:11:51,869
My car was stolen!

176
00:11:51,869 --> 00:11:52,950
I already reported it!

177
00:12:04,310 --> 00:12:05,349
It really wasn't me!

178
00:12:05,349 --> 00:12:06,552
I swear it wasn't me!

179
00:12:22,109 --> 00:12:23,583
It wasn't me!

180
00:12:29,469 --> 00:12:30,109
The owner

181
00:12:31,070 --> 00:12:32,229
wasn't the driver.

182
00:12:36,469 --> 00:12:38,109
You think Dongshan Tai did it?

183
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:41,910
Dongshan Tai couldn't cover
his tracks this well.

184
00:12:44,509 --> 00:12:45,509
The car's gone,

185
00:12:46,709 --> 00:12:47,589
and the driver

186
00:12:48,229 --> 00:12:49,550
vanished into thin air.

187
00:12:51,629 --> 00:12:53,109
Feels more like something
the cops would do.

188
00:12:58,910 --> 00:13:01,430
But if it were the cops,
they'd be coming after me.

189
00:13:08,509 --> 00:13:09,589
I just think...

190
00:13:11,709 --> 00:13:13,310
my brother is gone

191
00:13:14,869 --> 00:13:16,270
without leaving a single word behind.

192
00:13:18,229 --> 00:13:19,709
Even if I wanted revenge,

193
00:13:21,229 --> 00:13:22,749
I wouldn't even know who to go after.

194
00:13:29,270 --> 00:13:30,109
Have something sweet.

195
00:13:30,790 --> 00:13:32,270
It might make you feel a little better.

196
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,509
The shot-caller election is in two days.

197
00:13:48,790 --> 00:13:49,709
What are you going to do?

198
00:13:54,709 --> 00:13:56,509
Looks like I don't stand much
of a chance.

199
00:13:58,910 --> 00:14:00,709
Once Dongshan Tai becomes
the shot-caller,

200
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:02,430
he won't let me off the hook.

201
00:14:13,709 --> 00:14:14,629
Fu would want

202
00:14:14,629 --> 00:14:16,310
you to live a good life.

203
00:14:18,109 --> 00:14:18,829
Lin.

204
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:21,109
Let's

205
00:14:21,790 --> 00:14:23,109
leave Dongcheng Gang together.

206
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:26,030
Leave all this violence behind.

207
00:14:33,390 --> 00:14:34,469
I don't have a home

208
00:14:35,190 --> 00:14:36,629
or any family left.

209
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:39,509
Where would I go if I left
Dongcheng Gang?

210
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:43,109
You know what it took

211
00:14:43,109 --> 00:14:44,150
for me to get this far.

212
00:14:51,349 --> 00:14:52,869
I'm not giving up.

213
00:14:56,749 --> 00:14:58,270
To avenge Boss Hui,

214
00:15:00,310 --> 00:15:01,709
and so my brother can rest easy,

215
00:15:03,270 --> 00:15:05,070
even if there's only
the slightest chance,

216
00:15:05,749 --> 00:15:06,950
I'm gonna fight my way to the top.

217
00:15:11,829 --> 00:15:12,910
If that batch of Yaba

218
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:13,829
really belongs to Dongshan Tai,

219
00:15:16,070 --> 00:15:17,070
will you help me?

220
00:15:34,709 --> 00:15:36,829
How's that thing I asked you
to look into?

221
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:38,229
There've been boats

222
00:15:38,229 --> 00:15:39,589
coming and going from Fei Liu's
docks nonstop.

223
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:41,029
Also,

224
00:15:41,469 --> 00:15:42,790
we've got a lead on that batch of Yaba.

225
00:15:43,709 --> 00:15:45,509
Tidao tracked down
a few street-level dealers.

226
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:46,977
Stay on them.

227
00:15:47,709 --> 00:15:48,989
We need to trace them back
to their supplier.

228
00:15:50,401 --> 00:15:50,910
Got it.

229
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:57,270
(Dongcheng Tiger)

230
00:15:57,270 --> 00:15:58,446
Did you find the guy I asked for?

231
00:16:00,229 --> 00:16:01,190
He's coming in through the shantytown.

232
00:16:01,869 --> 00:16:02,869
He can cross the border tomorrow night.

233
00:16:04,469 --> 00:16:05,670
Keep this quiet.

234
00:16:06,229 --> 00:16:07,589
Send him back once the job's done.

235
00:16:08,109 --> 00:16:09,150
What about Boss Che?
